      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過我以後不會再做麵包做過頭，\n會好好珍惜和狗仔包在一起的時間。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904E62114EE55F8C4E0D6703518D505A9EB55305505A904E982DFF0C000A6703597D597D73CD60DC548C72D74ED4530557284E008D77768466429593300200100002011401C30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為大家都知道\n我不知道的狗仔包的可愛之處，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這讓我很不甘心啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǃ",
